      "unit": "U2",
      "test": "owed by the E3 core plan"
    }
  ],
  "description": "The target ends its telnet session by closing the socket (EOF, RST): the worker sends connection_lost cause transport, listing the session, which ends terminated / connection_lost. Telnet has no end message, so there is no target_disconnect and no channel_closed by: target. When the target's socket closes with the session, the worker stops that connection's link timers and sends no further link_state for it. The audit says terminated / connection_lost. U3 test with telnetlib3's in-process server; the U2 test; both owed.",
  "corpus": [
    "session model §9 E5",
    "session model T9",
    "session model §13",
    "Contract §15"
  ],
  "case": {
    "socket": "conn-control",
    "messages": [
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "connect",
          "target_id": "fixture-telnet",
          "protocol": "telnet",
          "host": "192.0.2.10",
          "port": 23,
          "term": "xterm-256color",
          "cols": 120,
          "rows": 40,
          "timers": {
            "heartbeat_interval": 10000,
            "heartbeat_missed": 3,
            "keepalive_interval": 4000,
            "keepalive_count_max": 2,
            "keepalive_probe_interval": 1500,
            "connection_linger": 0,
            "orphan_timeout": 60000,
            "idle": 900000,
            "unattended": 1800000
          },
          "buffer_bytes": 65536,
          "input_frame_max": 4096
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "connected",
          "conn_id": "fixture-conn-1"
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "open_shell",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "term": "xterm-256color",
          "cols": 120,
          "rows": 40
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "channel_opened",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "session_type": "shell",
          "socket": "shell.sock"
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "connection_lost",
          "conn_id": "fixture-conn-1",
          "session_ids": ["fixture-session-a"],
          "cause": "transport",
          "reason": "the target closed the socket"
        },
        "note": "the session ends terminated / connection_lost; no end message precedes it"
      }
    ]
  }
